{"ID":"20240118151434-euc3ypw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240118151434-euc3ypw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151434-euc3ypw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151434-e5rlio9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119114223-3e68ew3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240119114057-ekjjpjq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:26,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:26\u0026#125;","title":"006硝石","type":"doc","updated":"20240606170324"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151434-e5rlio9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151434-e5rlio9","updated":"20240119114147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主五脏积热，胃张闭，涤去蓄结饮食，推陈致新除邪气，炼之如膏，久服轻身。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114057-ekjjpjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114057-ekjjpjq","updated":"20240606170324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴普曰消石，农曰苦，扁鹊曰甘，名医曰一名芒消。今之硝石。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114106-sr19nc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114106-sr19nc5","updated":"20240119114149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产于东印度埃及等热带地方及我国西北。投入火中则爆鸣，立即燃烧而发鲜明之焰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114117-tw305sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114117-tw305sy","updated":"20240119114150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性寒，无毒， "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114119-vwlb59r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114119-vwlb59r","updated":"20240119114151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】硝石主清积热利小便，治五淋。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114122-1tdlkjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114122-1tdlkjs","updated":"20240119114152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗五脏十二经脉中百二十疾，暴伤寒，腹中大热，止烦满消渴利小便，及瘘蚀疮，能化七十二种石。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114125-e00fcos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114125-e00fcos","updated":"20240119114153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】破积散坚，治腹胀，破血下瘰疬。泻得根出。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114127-19byydr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114127-19byydr","updated":"20240119114154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】含咽治喉痹。黑疸，周身皮肤眼目俱现黑色，为疸症之最重者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114128-gm56fu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114128-gm56fu1","updated":"20240119114156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】消积解癖。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114130-9l306bo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114130-9l306bo","updated":"20240119114155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至一钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114131-0g9g8ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114131-0g9g8ck","updated":"20240119114157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】忌火。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114133-h38he4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114133-h38he4t","updated":"20240119114157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】拣去杂质即可。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240119114146-nrki75a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114146-nrki75a"}},{"ID":"20240119114204-uza60uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114204-uza60uh","updated":"20240124102043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第六个，这个我们讲的硝石。硝石跟芒硝不一样。这里讲的硝石，就是我们过去做炸药的硝石，会爆炸的，你要看看说“老师我煮煮它，看是不是真硝石”，你去火去点，砰，那个脸黑的。那道士就是就是装神弄鬼的时候他就拿硝石粉一洒就，哇，那火就变得很大，那就是硝石，中药的硝石。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114205-iaxnzhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114205-iaxnzhm","updated":"20240124102224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硝石可以入药，当然可以入药，我们很有名的硝石矾石散，黑疸的时候，黑就是人整个黑掉，眼睛都黑的，皮肤都黑的，很危险，那快死掉了，我们用硝石跟矾石，这个会混在一起用。那硝石，诸位看，它味本身是苦寒的药，专治五脏积热，胃这个张闭，没有办法吞东西，涤去蓄结，里面胃里面东西吞不下去了。这个炼之如膏，久服轻身。名医那个上面写说芒硝其实跟我们后面的芒硝不一样，他只是另外的一个名称而已。这个硝石，真正的硝石丢到火里面就会鸣爆，那这个本身没有毒性的，可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114214-jrclxuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114214-jrclxuj","updated":"20240124102321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那炮制的，你不能炮制啊，一炮制就完了，炸掉了，没有啦。你就捡把硝石把它拿起来，杂质捡捡就好了。同时捡杂质的时候最好弄个竹筷子或者怎么样子，你不要拿个金属的东西嘎嘎捡，在那边制造问题，那个火屑出来就会爆炸。那在含在嘴巴里面的时候，硝石因为性是爆炸的性很强，所以你就把它含在嘴巴里面，喉咙里面不能吞东西了，放硝石下去，硝石就生用啊，放下去，喉咙就会撑开来。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114218-v2esw6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114218-v2esw6r","updated":"20240124102441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那后面讲了，【大明】就是含在喉咙里面治喉闭，不能吞东西了。那黑疸，全，周身皮肤眼目俱现黑色，疸：我们有黄疸呐，很多各种不同的疸，女疸啊，女色太过了。黑疸，那在经方里面我们都有这个药，硝石矾石散就是经方。那这里就讲的硝石。"}]},{"ID":"20240119114223-3e68ew3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240119114223-3e68ew3","updated":"20240124102746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】当然就是忌火啦。那普通五分，一钱，剂量不多，剂量不多。一般都是生用，直接生用，你也不要去，我们过去有那个钵有没有那个铜，铜的钵，你把它放进去打碎，打碎以后不是做粉，那“老师硝石我打碎”，你就是，这个是commonsense没有，打了还爆炸，插那边象个手榴弹一样，你还在那边打，你如果说真的打就好像在那边加油站那边点火，你不要那么白目，对啊，烧死人了。我们会用到，经方有用到。"}]}]}